map Player
action Move vector
bind keys W S A D
bind keys UpArrow DownArrow LeftArrow RightArrow
bind stick left
bind touch Move
action Use button
bind key E
bind pad North
bind touch Use
action Ability1 button
bind key F
bind key Space
bind pad South
bind touch Chop
action Sprint button
bind key LeftShift
bind pad LeftShoulder
bind touch Sprint
